# Build context excludes — keep the image small and never ship local state/secrets.
#
# packages/ml is the pierre-ml submodule (the severity-api). It is a SEPARATE service with its
# own deployment and is consumed over HTTP, so nothing in this image references it — but it
# carries ~300 MB of Git-LFS model weights under serving_assets/, which would otherwise be
# uploaded as build context on every local `docker build`. CI never checked it out, so this
# cost only ever landed on whoever built the image by hand.
packages/ml
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
release
apps/backend/data
apps/backend/.env
.env
.env.*
!.env.cloud.example
**/*.log
.git
.github
docs
*.md
!apps/landing/README.md
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
